{# What is this report #}
<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">What is this report?</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">The State of AI in Nepal 2026</strong> is the first comprehensive analysis of artificial intelligence adoption across Nepali industries. Based on research from 50+ organizations in Kathmandu and beyond, this report provides actionable insights for business leaders planning AI investments.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Nepal ranks 150th globally in AI readiness, yet adoption is accelerating. Only 31.8% of businesses have dedicated AI budgets, and 56% cite lack of skilled manpower as their primary barrier. This report bridges the knowledge gap with practical frameworks tailored for Nepal's market conditions.
  </p>
</div>

